, "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "representable by a scheme", "target_term": "由概形可表的"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "2-isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n令<MATH_0001>为包含在<MATH_0002>中的概形（scheme）。\n本章研究的基本对象（object）将是群胚纤维化范畴（category fibred in groupoids）\n<MATH_0003>，参见《范畴（Categories）》，定义<REF_0001>。\n我们常常简单地说“令<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>上的群胚纤维化范畴（category fibred in groupoids）”来表示这一情形。\n一个<MATH_0006>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，所涉及的范畴（categories）纤维化于群胚（groupoids）且位于<MATH_0008>之上，将指一个<MATH_0009>-态射（morphism），在<MATH_0010>-范畴（category）中考虑；其中的范畴（categories）纤维化于群胚（groupoids）且位于<MATH_0011>之上，参见《范畴（Categories）》，定义<REF_0002>。\n它就是一个函子（functor）<MATH_0012>，位于<MATH_0013>之上。\n回顾这实际上是一个<MATH_0014>-范畴（category），且所有<MATH_0015>-纤维积（fibre products）都存在。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n令<MATH_0016>为<MATH_0017>上的群胚纤维化范畴（category fibred in groupoids）。\n回顾，称<MATH_0018>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>可表的（representable）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是指存在概形（scheme）<MATH_0019>以及范畴（categories）之间的等价（equivalence）\n<MATH_0020>，它位于<MATH_0021>之上，参见《范畴（Categories）》，定义<REF_0003>。\n我们有时会说<MATH_0022>是<TEXTITOPEN_0002>由概形可表的（representable by a scheme）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，以区别于<MATH_0023>由代数空间（algebraic space）可表（representable）的情形（见下文）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n若<MATH_0024>纤维化于群胚（groupoids），且由<MATH_0025>可表（representable），则有\n<MATHSEG_0001>-同构（2-isomorphism）<MATHSEG_0002>\n参见《范畴（Categories）》，引理<REF_0004>。\n更确切地，任意<MATH_0026>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0027>都产生一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0028>。\n反之，给定概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0029>，它位于<MATH_0030>之上，存在一个<MATH_0031>-态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0032>，它产生<MATH_0033>，且在唯一<MATH_0034>-同构（isomorphism）的意义下唯一。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:e09c7b552fe2ac4cd256879dbb539e77c55e939cafdba66538eeab43aa0b2e12", "unit_id": "tag:02ZQ:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "此处研究可表的群胚纤维化范畴。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "本章的基本研究对象。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "以概形范畴为底的群胚纤维化范畴。", "source_term": "category fibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚纤维化范畴"}, {"context": "所引用的范畴章节。", "source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "群胚纤维化范畴或概形之间的态射。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "群胚纤维化范畴组成的二范畴。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "范畴纤维化于群胚。", "source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "此处为二范畴。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "保持底的函子。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "此处指二纤维积。", "source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"context": "保持底的范畴等价。", "source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "群胚纤维化范畴的可表性。", "source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表的"}, {"context": "由概形或代数空间表示。", "source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"context": "与由代数空间可表的情形区分。", "source_term": "representable by a scheme", "target_term": "由概形可表的"}, {"context": "可表性所用的表示对象。", "source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "受保护数字2与可译后缀组成二同构。", "source_term": "2-isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "态射所对应的概形。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "最后受保护数字限定的唯一同构。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}]}
